# Artifacts deliberately absent from llms.txt, each with a reason.
#
# The rule: anything served from this site is indexed in llms.txt, or it is
# listed here. Silence is not an option -- an unindexed page is invisible to an
# agent handed the index, and that breaks the contract llms.txt makes.
#
# Format: <glob>  # reason
# Checked by scripts/check_index.py, enforced in CI.

README.md                              # repo housekeeping, not a publication
*_draft.md                             # superseded drafts of the essay; the PDF is the published form
agent/index.html                       # PWA application shell, not prose
research/sleep-wave-theory.md          # markdown source of sleep-learning-wave-theory.html
research/papers/SUBMISSION_GUIDE.md    # internal note on journal submission mechanics
research/wave-backprop.html            # Chinese-language duplicate of the wave-backprop-en.html archive notice
ideas/index.html                       # DEAD PATH: the separate repo MachengShen/ideas has its own GitHub Pages site mounted at /ideas/, which shadows this folder entirely. Nothing under ideas/ in this repo is ever served. Kept only so the shadowing is documented rather than rediscovered; new essays go in essays/.
